==Battleground==
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Mobius (Enemy)|Mobius]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

